{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:695","content":{"id":695,"title":"解码方法","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7ec77268-a905-439a-ac54-360b7fca437c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cbda1625-43e8-4f2a-8178-7c69f2bdaaad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一条包含字母 A-Z 的消息通过以下映射进行了编码 ："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"8003fdbf-9062-4a50-8a01-ea0cbf6ae35c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a4e9729f-70a3-4e92-9f3e-d04b49d3401c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"'A' -> 1\n'B' -> 2\n...\n'Z' -> 26","collabId":"c2ad27ae-75b6-4410-9c5a-064c995f8a03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"00c8c803-b13b-4895-a0b6-1e263859e8cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要 解码 已编码的消息，所有数字必须基于上述映射的方法，反向映射回字母（可能有多种方法）。例如，\"11106\" 可以映射为："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"787a941a-3e68-49d4-b459-fe31cf4ef25d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"14df981a-807e-4af1-b69a-b9a9e62b65c8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c9244b07-b6e3-4e1e-a41d-e57959b18287","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\"AAJF\"，将消息分组为 (1 1 10 6)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b079631f-eedb-4e48-890e-04d151adab5b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"95255f16-3515-463c-bb6b-d6597a52d2ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\"KJF\"，将消息分组为 (11 10 6)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7aba7e8a-d7ce-49e5-8705-1113be962698","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意，消息不能分组为 (1 11 06 ，因为 \"06\" 不能映射为 \"F\" ，这是由于 \"6\" 和 \"06\" 在映射中并不等价。给你一个只含数字的非空字符串 s，请计算并返回解码方法的总数。题目数据保证答案肯定是一个 32 位的整数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"40aa14d3-23ec-45c6-a05d-5654a233add0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"70a7aac2-bf24-457c-af66-9b2aa9896b25","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1737816e-aee9-4d18-8549-6077508513cd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：s = \"12\"\n输出：2\n解释：它可以解码为 \"AB\"（1 2）或者 \"L\"（12）","collabId":"485baf65-a082-404a-9005-2cb777961693","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf6cffd3-cdbd-41f4-9f51-bf308199b153","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"227ecd73-f97b-4c93-810b-06c465156a68","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d0525ba0-04cb-4b59-87ef-d84e18a888f2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：s = \"226\"\n输出：3\n解释：它可以解码为 \"BZ\" (2 26), \"VF\" (22 6), 或者 \"BBF\" (2 2 6) ","collabId":"b371ef44-6517-4f25-8378-8d629b9738b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d023d231-3ddf-40a9-83c7-8c42c87e3f82","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例3："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"aa3c91b0-14d2-421f-973a-2d004ad4763b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"277e8f54-ce2d-4bf2-97c6-ed79d33a7718","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：s = \"0\"\n输出：0\n解释：没有字符映射到以 0 开头的数字","collabId":"eacc13e2-6297-4bf4-8e16-c19fe7f644e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c30e93b9-defd-42b4-8b7a-d6594e1ea39d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"145197ee-d9c4-4259-a2bc-f5699753a35b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动态规划"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78bb50fa-bfd4-431b-96f1-f3d91983f9c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们定义一个数组 dp，其中 dp[i] 表示以第 i 个字符结尾有多少种解码方法，所以可以得到 dp[i] 的更新公式，分为两种情况："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f3068349-d908-464c-a886-6f918ceaa181","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"aba91ed6-d950-4e1a-8661-c8901f400838","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb4653c6-2811-42d1-bfb1-0992c58996ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当前字符 str[i] == '0'"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"48231249-29cc-49fe-b0a3-d6f72326165c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5c86609a-0131-4ed4-915b-9d8db41086c7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"525662ba-6515-47f3-960d-705254228993","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当前字符与前一个字符组成的数小于等于 26 并且前一个字符不为 0，则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"dp[i] = dp[i - 2]","collabId":"d21ec637-d03c-4bd4-914e-aba90ee52b99","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3c676832-a8ff-4eeb-988f-d0eec19e478b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f8067b0d-2925-4e3c-bdae-16c52338378d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"否则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"dp[i] = 0","collabId":"5ecc33e9-6cf3-4ba0-b237-4a020a107167","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e9d39a87-d319-473c-b1af-5efca7970639","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61e0b85d-e097-45eb-813d-1c8c43586ea0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当前字符 str[i] != '0'"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f4241a30-0fe9-4e94-bce4-d48ee9595f14","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"34205207-eb4a-4a46-b4e8-fc61cd0e2620","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"93fa7713-6ea7-4852-b09f-39d2d231c38b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当前字符与前一个字符组成的数小于等于 26 并且前一个字符不为 0，则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + dp[i - 2]","collabId":"9dd85ec5-471f-4946-be76-f5df017ca311","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"98421177-4f98-4045-82e9-ef592169f122","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8bad4fa0-39db-4b0c-9114-eea287c10af7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"否则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"dp[i] = dp[i - 1]","collabId":"119ec33a-cfa7-491e-ab2a-0d1fc26fc531","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"d9a0eee4-7293-43d6-aaed-feb2949ce0c4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7e5a507f-7fe3-4740-a1ac-c048dd7e6ce1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int numDecodings(String s) {\n    int length = s.length();\n    int[] dp = new int[length];\n    if (s.charAt(0) == '0') {\n        dp[0] = 0;\n    } else {\n        dp[0] = 1;\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i < length; i++) {\n        if (s.charAt(i) != '0') {\n            dp[i] = dp[i - 1];\n        }\n        int n = (s.charAt(i - 1) - '0') * 10 + s.charAt(i) - '0';\n        if (n <= 26) {\n            dp[i] = i > 1 ? dp[i] + dp[i - 2]: dp[i] + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return dp[length - 1];\n}","collabId":"2fbb44e3-f9f9-4365-a6fd-ee61a5f9e6bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4edd126d-2544-4586-80ad-28d2e06bb49b.webp","uuid":"1271327c-aae2-41cb-8870-f5bf32abd949","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4edd126d-2544-4586-80ad-28d2e06bb49b.webp","width":454.1666486197055,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"35ccc5ba-d465-419c-9a94-ef39beb127f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1aab5e42-fb0e-4be7-8198-294b30df5484","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"空间压缩"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1626c587-3f66-4316-841b-05a620401081","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分析上面的程序，我们只用到了 dp[i - 1] 与 dp[i - 2] 两个元素，所以我们根本不需要使用一个数组来存储，只需存储这两个元素即可，我们使用 cur 表示 dp[i - 1]，pre 表示 dp[i - 2]"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"ae268ab5-2b34-47f3-aa83-cf6f54efc591","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"39178a48-8123-4bcc-a2db-989e2ea8e173","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int numDecodings(String s) {\n    int length = s.length();\n    int cur;\n    int pre = 0;\n    if (s.charAt(0) == '0') {\n        cur = 0;\n    } else {\n        cur = 1;\n    }\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < length; i++) {\n        int temp = cur;\n        if (s.charAt(i) == '0') {\n            cur = 0;\n        }\n        int n = (s.charAt(i - 1) - '0') * 10 + s.charAt(i) - '0';\n        if (n <= 26 && (s.charAt(i - 1) - '0') != 0) {\n            cur = i > 1 ? cur + pre: cur + 1;\n        }\n        pre = temp;\n    }\n\n    return cur;\n}","collabId":"37e5e5fd-89ba-4372-b426-7c3ed8e3745f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ffec43c-9205-434b-b5e4-325759737216","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"空间复杂度大大降低"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f0f26ddd-2877-448c-9937-7c14ff39a71e.webp","uuid":"ab6569d4-5d15-4e72-bfce-66d90eb5f85b","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f0f26ddd-2877-448c-9937-7c14ff39a71e.webp","width":462.91664827201174,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"a34a2ee7-d9be-4a2c-b5d4-ee19fb217865","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"2e94e772-4d99-4175-9441-9c977caee732","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4954f2ef-7733-4648-a8a3-8dbaf560bbcf","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"085a8f94-64f0-4ab9-a983-f79acefc83e9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f06c76aa-96ed-4d88-bd43-627a1f010412","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/decode-ways","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"7ce45f6e-2327-4d55-af91-165b6d9e664f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解码方法"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"d